excerpt: "Innate vs adaptive immunity, active vs passive, vaccine ke 5 prakar aur India ka Universal Immunization Programme — NCERT se aage ka UPSC-level explainer.",
body: `
<h2>Pratiraksha Tantra (Immunity): Deeper Samajh</h2><h3>Immunity ke 2 Prakar</h3><ul><li><b>1. Innate (sahaj) immunity:</b> Janm se milti hai, <b>avishisht</b> (non-specific). Udaharan — twacha (skin barrier), shleshma, pet ka acid, <b>phagocytes</b> (macrophage, neutrophil) jo rogjanakon ko nigal lete hain. <b>Inflammation</b> isi ka hissa.</li><li><b>2. Adaptive (arjit) immunity:</b> <b>Vishisht</b> (specific) aur <b>smriti</b> (memory) wali. <b>B-lymphocytes</b> antibodies banate hain (humoral immunity); <b>T-lymphocytes</b> sankramit koshikaon ko nasht karte hain (cell-mediated immunity).</li></ul><h3>Active vs Passive Immunity</h3><ul><li><b>Active:</b> Shareer khud antibody banata hai — <b>sankraman</b> se ya <b>teeka (vaccination)</b> se. Dheere banti hai, <b>lambe samay</b> tak rehti hai.</li><li><b>Passive:</b> Taiyar antibody milti hai — <b>maa ke doodh/placenta</b> se shishu ko, ya <b>antiserum</b> injection se. Turant asar, <b>alpakaalik</b>.</li></ul><h3>Vaccine ke 5 Prakar (Prelims favourite)</h3><ul><li><b>Live attenuated</b> (kamzor jeevit) — <b>BCG</b> (TB), MMR, OPV.</li><li><b>Inactivated</b> (mrit) — <b>IPV</b> (polio injection).</li><li><b>Subunit</b> (protein ka tukda) — <b>Hepatitis B</b> vaccine.</li><li><b>Toxoid</b> (vish-rahit toxin) — <b>Tetanus, Diphtheria</b>.</li><li><b>mRNA</b> — COVID-19 ke kuch vaccines; koshika ko <b>antigen protein banane ka nirdesh</b> deta hai.</li></ul><h3>India ke Swasthya Programme</h3><ul><li><b>Universal Immunization Programme (UIP)</b> — <b>1985</b> me shuru, duniya ke sabse bade teekakaran karyakramon me se ek.</li><li><b>Mission Indradhanush</b> — <b>25 December 2014</b> ko shuru; chhoote hue bachchon aur garbhavati mahilaon tak teeka pahunchana.</li><li>UIP ke antargat: BCG, OPV, Hepatitis B, Pentavalent, Rotavirus, <b>Measles-Rubella</b>, PCV (pneumonia), DPT.</li><li><b>Herd immunity</b> — jab paryapt aabadi pratirakshit ho to sankraman fail nahi pata; teekakaran ka samudayik labh.</li></ul><blockquote><b>Mains angle:</b> Vaccine hesitancy aur 'last-mile delivery' — Mission Indradhanush jaise lakshit abhiyan swasthya asamanata ko kam karte hain; sasti swadeshi vaccine kshamata (Serum Institute) India ko 'pharmacy of the world' banati hai.</blockquote>
`
